# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "Arahan pemasangan untuk versi terkini Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Arahan pemasangan"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Arahan pemasangan {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To install, first create a new Python environment:\n"
msgstr "Untuk memasang, mula-mula cipta persekitaran Python baharu:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prasyarat {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Cipta persekitaran minimum dengan hanya Python dipasang di dalamnya. Kami mengesyorkan penggunaan [persekitaran maya Python](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan persekitaran baharu anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "On Windows, run `\\path\\to\\virtual\\environment\\Scripts\\activate` instead.\n"
msgstr "Pada Windows, jalankan `\\path\\to\\virtual\\environment\\Scripts\\activate` sebagai ganti.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package – from PyPI or source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Terdapat dua cara utama untuk memasang pakej ini – daripada PyPI atau sumber. Kaedah yang diutamakan ialah memasang daripada PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Pasang daripada PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The optional `sbd` and `fulqrum` extras, and the `notebook-dependencies` extra that includes them, are supported only on Linux and macOS.\n"
msgstr "Extras `sbd` dan `fulqrum` pilihan, dan extra `notebook-dependencies` yang merangkumi kedua-duanya, hanya disokong pada Linux dan macOS.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Pasang daripada sumber {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source if you wish to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally.\n"
msgstr "Pasang daripada sumber jika anda ingin membangun dalam repositori atau menjalankan notebook secara setempat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first step is to clone the `qiskit-addon-sqd` repository.\n"
msgstr "Langkah pertama ialah mengklon repositori `qiskit-addon-sqd`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade pip and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, naik taraf pip dan masuk ke dalam repositori.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-addon-sqd` to the virtual environment. If you plan on running the notebooks, install the notebook dependencies in order to run all the visualizations in the notebooks. Install the `dev` dependencies if you plan on developing in the repository.\n"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya ialah memasang `qiskit-addon-sqd` ke dalam persekitaran maya. Jika anda bercadang menjalankan notebook, pasang kebergantungan notebook untuk menjalankan semua visualisasi dalam notebook. Pasang kebergantungan `dev` jika anda bercadang membangun dalam repositori.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Laraskan pilihan di bawah mengikut keperluan anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda telah memasang kebergantungan notebook, anda boleh bermula dengan menjalankan notebook dalam dokumentasi.\n"
